div class="select-none cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-visible" style="opacity: 1; height: auto;"><div class="text-text-secondary rounded-8 group flex h-6 min-w-0 items-center overflow-visible text-start" data-testid="thinking-status" data-thinking-state="in-progress"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-0.5"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 text-subheadline text-text-secondary truncate" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px);">Show thinking</div></div><span class="text-text-secondary flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" data-testid="thinking-status-chevron"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20"><path d="M12.38 24.62a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 0l8-8a.876.876 0 0 0 0-1.239l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 1.238L19.76 16l-7.38 7.381a.877.877 0 0 0 0 1.238z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="-ms-[25px] flex flex-col ps-px" data-testid="subagent-cot-list" data-subagent-list-phase="live" data-subagent-pulse-direction="down" style="--subagent-cot-pulse-length-px: 0px; --subagent-connector-branch-window-top-px: 14px; --subagent-cot-pulse-top-px: 0px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="grid min-w-0"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack max-w-conversation mx-auto flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="prose prose-trimmed ur-markdown citation-aware"><div class="ur-sm mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6" style="--ur-sm-fade-duration: 150ms;"><p dir="auto">First, one clarification: you uploaded a <strong>Word file</strong> (<code>26CSMM19-Final_3.docx</code>), not a PDF. I converted it to PDF to check the real pagination. It renders as <strong>89 PDF pages</strong>, but only <strong>83 printed pages</strong>, because the front matter is unnumbered.</p><h2 dir="auto" class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl">The good news: the TOC page numbers are actually correct</h2><p dir="auto">This is the part most people get wrong, so it's worth being precise:</p><ul dir="ltr" class="list-inside whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:ps-6 list-disc"><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline">The footer page-number field restarts at <strong>1</strong> on the page where Chapter 1 starts (PDF page 7).</li><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline">So <strong>printed page = PDF page − 6</strong>.</li><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline">Checked against the TOC, every entry lines up, for example:</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack max-w-conversation mx-auto flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div class="ur-sm-segment" style="--ur-sm-fade-duration: 150ms;"><div class="group/table"><div class="flex w-full justify-center"><div class="w-max min-w-full max-w-[max(100%,var(--ur-table-max-width,0px))] shrink-0 overflow-x-auto pb-2 ur-table__wrapper" style="overflow: clip;"><table dir="ltr" class="w-full table-auto"><thead class="data-sticky-header:sticky data-sticky-header:top-[var(--ur-table-sticky-top,0px)] data-sticky-header:z-1 data-sticky-header:bg-bg-primary data-sticky-header:[&amp;&gt;tr:first-child&gt;th]:relative data-sticky-header:[&amp;&gt;tr:first-child&gt;th]:before:absolute data-sticky-header:[&amp;&gt;tr:first-child&gt;th]:before:inset-x-0 data-sticky-header:[&amp;&gt;tr:first-child&gt;th]:before:bottom-[calc(100%-1px)] data-sticky-header:[&amp;&gt;tr:first-child&gt;th]:before:h-[calc(var(--ur-table-sticky-top,0px)+1px)] data-sticky-header:[&amp;&gt;tr:first-child&gt;th]:before:bg-bg-primary" data-sticky-header=""><tr><th dir="auto" class="text-subheadline te