 1 .262-.625.89.89 0 0 1 .625-.262.83.83 0 0 1 .612.263l.386.414c.698.747 1.407 1.483 2.12 2.216V4a.875.875 0 0 1 1.75 0v13.006a151.522 151.522 0 0 0 2.507-2.625.83.83 0 0 1 .612-.262.89.89 0 0 1 .625.263.89.89 0 0 1 .262.625.83.83 0 0 1-.263.612l-.414.386a153.944 153.944 0 0 0-3.663 3.54.759.759 0 0 1-1.09 0 153.955 153.955 0 0 0-4.07-3.927.83.83 0 0 1-.262-.612z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="ur-code-block__content"><div class="prose"><div class="ur-sm mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6" style="--ur-sm-fade-duration: 150ms;"><pre dir="ltr" class="ur-sm-code ur-sm-shiki"><code><span class="ur-sm-line">margin-bottom: 15px;nesd</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack max-w-conversation mx-auto flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="prose prose-trimmed ur-markdown citation-aware"><div class="ur-sm mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6" style="--ur-sm-fade-duration: 150ms;"><p dir="auto">That stray <code>nesd</code> will stand out if anyone reads the code.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl">6. Massive duplication + truncated code lines</h3><ul dir="ltr" class="list-inside whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:ps-6 list-disc"><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline">The <strong>entire <code>style.css</code> is pasted 4 times</strong>, the <strong>entire <code>script.js</code> 4 times</strong>, and the <strong>entire <code>server.js</code> 4 times</strong>, once per module. That is why an 83-page report is mostly repetition.</li><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline">Several long code lines are <strong>cut off at the right margin</strong> instead of wrapping, e.g. in <code>server.js</code> the event descriptions end mid-word: <code>“Explore technology, coding competitions and exciti…”, “Build creative solutions and showcase your coding …”, “Capture memorable moments and share your creativit…”</code>.</li></ul><h2 dir="auto" class="mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl">Verdict</h2><ul dir="ltr" class="list-inside whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:ps-6 list-disc"><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline"><strong>TOC + page numbers:</strong> ✅ Correct, leave them alone.</li><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline"><strong>Ready to submit:</strong> ❌ No.</li></ul><p dir="auto">Fix in this order: add the missing screenshots and delete the “Insert screenshots…” placeholders, add the missing 4.2.1 HTML code, resolve the Mathematics vs Electronics and Physics mismatch, delete <code>nesd</code>, and put the TOC (and ideally each chapter) on a fresh page.</p><p dir="auto">Want me to fix the Word file directly — remove the placeholders, fix the typo, put the TOC on its own page, and correct the degree name once you tell me which one is right?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-conversation"></div><div class="group/assistant-message-actions max-w-conversation mx-auto flex min-h-11 flex-wrap items-center select-none"><div data-slot="flexbox" class="min-h-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-1 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:-ms-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 ecto-message-action-cascade"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Like this response" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" class="m-0.5" size="20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m10.894 6.447 1.715-3.429c.56.107.939.669.794 1.247L13.04 5.72l-.988 2