appears <strong>nowhere</strong> in the file anymore, so this version is safe to share/submit.</p><ol dir="ltr" class="list-inside whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:ps-6 list-decimal" start="3"><li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline"><strong>§5.2 caption corrected</strong> — Figure 5.1 now honestly says “schematic representation of the students, events and registrations collections…” instead of implying it's a live Compass capture.</li></ol><p dir="auto"><strong>Re-verified after the fixes:</strong> TOC updated for the pages that shifted (4.2.1: 23 → 24, 4.2.4: 33 → 34, 4.2.5: 41 → 42), all TOC numbers still in the straight right-aligned column (540.2 pt), 100 pages total.</p><p dir="auto"><strong>The one thing I <em>can't</em> fix for you:</strong> a real MongoDB Compass screenshot for §5.2 — that needs your own MongoDB running. If you can run Compass once, just screenshot <code>collegeEventDB</code> → <code>students</code> / <code>events</code> / <code>registrations</code> and swap it for Figure 5.1. Everything else is now fully corrected.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-conversation"></div><div class="group/assistant-message-actions max-w-conversation mx-auto flex min-h-11 flex-wrap items-center select-none"><div data-slot="flexbox" class="min-h-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-1 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:-ms-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 ecto-message-action-cascade"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Like this response" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 