 poster featuring me in a wide shot composite, in the story of my life/career, random genre.\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[]},{\"id\":\"1635630801554001\",\"agentOption\":\"MODE_THINKING\",\"chipTitle\":\"me on vintage TV\",\"clipTextRange\":{\"offset\":6,\"length\":16},\"displayedTitle\":\"Watch me on vintage TV\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"Watch Me on vintage tv\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\"thumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin11-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMGJoaO19rsQ6KytiT0fXi_deLejFvmA_KL1nJkLVH8ON4fDfltIqnSnxcghqbuorQ3ks8EGkWvuc3I9b6cOwSv.png?_nc_cat=104\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=JPB911LsSWYQ7kNvwHeshxv\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQTQOluhjcJAMbvvZ8ivD7xckXTDdmlX1-VE-bO4i-w6ig\u0026oe=6B18DDE4\",\"squareThumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin11-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMGJoaO19rsQ6KytiT0fXi_deLejFvmA_KL1nJkLVH8ON4fDfltIqnSnxcghqbuorQ3ks8EGkWvuc3I9b6cOwSv.png?_nc_cat=104\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=JPB911LsSWYQ7kNvwHeshxv\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQTQOluhjcJAMbvvZ8ivD7xckXTDdmlX1-VE-bO4i-w6ig\u0026oe=6B18DDE4\",\"placeholderThumbnailUri\":null,\"capabilities\":[\"IMAGINE\"],\"isVideo\":false,\"category\":\"image\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"multipleAttachments\":false,\"suggestedAttachmentCount\":null,\"mediaPickerSubtitle\":null,\"promptText\":\"Put me on a vintage TV from a bygone era, on a show appropriate for the time, doing something related to my interests/job based on my connected Meta accounts. Style the TV and surroundings appropriately and degrade the image quality to match the era. Aspect ratio of TV should be 4:3.\",\"segments\":[{\"type\":\"static\",\"text\":\"Put me on a vintage TV from a bygone era, on a show appropriate for the time, doing something related to my interests/job based on my connected Meta accounts. Style the TV and surroundings appropriately and degrade the image quality to match the era. Aspect ratio of TV should be 4:3.\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[]},{\"id\":\"1574865224052064\",\"agentOption\":\"MODE_FAST\",\"chipTitle\":\"pedal car\",\"clipTextRange\":{\"offset\":7,\"length\":9},\"displayedTitle\":\"GIF me pedal car\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"GIF me Pedal car\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\"thumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMM3xW_PpBbqjC3QFUKLpiUZbbVSvtSgmj1CFL077mK-UtEYHc5fDsqVdP0aG1sjHaagsdrNaKKry2RVAvwdW8x.gif?_nc_cat=101\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=9r_L8WCVSrEQ7kNvwF-7i5J\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQQWk_uM3u915xpfHKMhyIa0t_glaROKsiWfOCJ7PY1IsQ\u0026oe=6B18CB27\",\"squareThumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMM3xW_PpBbqjC3QFUKLpiUZbbVSvtSgmj1CFL077mK-UtEYHc5fDsqVdP0aG1sjHaagsdrNaKKry2RVAvwdW8x.gif?_nc_cat=101\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=9r_L8WCVSrEQ7kNvwF-7i5J\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQQWk_uM3u915xpfHKMhyIa0t_glaROKsiWfOCJ7PY1IsQ\u0026oe=6B18CB27\",\"placeholderThumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin2-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMofY45LqUSXYsIea65hD_T7E50aMH9pz_Gq3TIY9_z0WGh3vSCJUwsMEEfbxKhZhIDXCuqCkcDbONtnAVuj12Q.jpg?_nc_cat=103\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=j1O4aBLS488Q7kNvwGpNLTL\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQRT1TGsSH94GU-BHYg5gsz1X40GT_0FJfPfbM_cIT7cIA\u0026oe=6B18E07D\",\"capabilities\":[\"IMAGINE\"],\"isVideo\":false,\"category\":\"image\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"multipleAttachments\":false,\"suggestedAttachmentCount\":null,\"mediaPickerSubtitle\":null,\"promptText\":\"Generate a smooth 6 fps animated GIF of me. Starts as a dramatic close-up on my face in a fighter pilot helmet, visor flips down – then a slow cinematic zoom out reveals that I'm actually sitting in a tiny comical children's pedal car on a suburban street. Smooth coherent motion, consistent throughout.\",\"segments\":[{\"type\":\"static\",\"text\":\"Generate a smooth 6 fps animated GIF of me. Starts as a dramatic close-up on my face in a fighter pilot helmet, visor flips down – then a slow cinematic zoom out reveals that I'm actually sitting in a tiny comical children's pedal car on a suburban street. Smooth coherent motion, consistent throughout.\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[]},{\"id\":\"1565191661535954\",\"agentOption\":null,\"chipTitle\":\"Portrait studio\",\"clipTextRange\":null,\"displayedTitle\":\"Turn this photo into a portrait\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"Turn this photo into a portrait\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\"thumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin6-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQP6zSAqxZxcDV0bVHqUlOrg5SU6vT35BEGIzbSNkc08nBCHr6Yv90sV3EQK_OdjTO61b0UmRxgdJ1En0ivrNU1S.webp?_nc_cat=109\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=I928VuzNlwUQ7kNvwGhz3-N\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQTpM_FYlY57yHQSQM6onkrbO1nb3sS440SD6y1PdqFofQ\u0026oe=6B18FD4A\",\"squareThumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin6-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQP6zSAqxZxcDV0bVHqUlOrg5SU6vT35BEGIzbSNkc08nBCHr6Yv90sV3EQK_OdjTO61b0UmRxgdJ1En0ivrNU1S.webp?_nc_cat=109\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=I928VuzNlwUQ7kNvwGhz3-N\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQTpM_FYlY57yHQSQM6onkrbO1nb3sS440SD6y1PdqFofQ\u0026oe=6B18FD4A\",\"placeholderThumbnailUri\":null,\"capabilities\":[\"IMAGINE\"],\"isVideo\":false,\"category\":\"image\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"multipleAttachments\":false,\"suggestedAttachmentCount\":null,\"mediaPickerSubtitle\":null,\"promptText\":\"Portrait studio using selected style\",\"segments\":[{\"type\":\"static\",\"text\":\"Portrait studio using selected style\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[{\"stepType\":\"IMAGE_PICKER\",\"suggestedMediaCount\":null,\"textSuggestions\":[],\"detailedSuggestions\":[],\"mediaSuggestions\":[],\"title\":\"Choose an image of a person\"},{\"stepType\":\"PORTRAIT_STUDIO_STYLES\",\"suggestedMediaCount\":null,\"textSuggestions\":[],\"detailedSuggestions\":[{\"label\":\"1021932084199777\",\"values\":[\"Golden Hour\",\"https://scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQPGfgMCjcNMwfubf5UzOajB0K2-noLd5u1oAQyd92yqAxg58sFzyVSsuBbPNfX60dgyr29CZqopsDLkrdGBbKdW.jpg?_nc_cat=100\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=qonZYKhi7I8Q7kNvwF5dnkP\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQQxV-mau3Y6fms656UOgtBwK5YzLmcIfDVeyhjzggdWkQ\u0026oe=6B18DAC4\",\"A warm, natural portrait of the person in the photo at golden hour, with soft sunset light behind them glowing through their hair. Body turned slightly to one side. Eyes can look at the camera or just past it. \\n\\nSoftly blurred outdoor background. Keep their face, features, clothes, and body exactly as they are. \\n\\nShot on 35mm film with a Kodak Portra look. No dust or scratches. Crisp focus on the eyes, warm natural skin tones, fine film grain.\\n\\nIf there’s more than one person in the photo, keep every person and every pet: in the same arrangement, with no one added, removed or merged.\"]},{\"label\":\"1442129404727338\",\"values\":[\"Aura photo\",\"https://scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQN8lDQKykjYTyGJbiJE-ztiPC4NrwCzf_TicPmaIZXU12wf0y3PkecpVUejLUes0sGrJU4qNU4p01sKnMOtODWx.jpg?_nc_cat=107\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=30XFS00du9oQ7kNvwExCOuv\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQQxL9yJXj2FY4M3ppW8vGXqIVnwqpCh1t3xVHlNLi8CqQ\u0026oe=6B18D585\",\"$117\"]},{\"label\":\"28554584367484404\",\"values\":[\"Night Flash\",\"https://scontent-sin2-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQNgK5hv3Ojkc-i9Kh34navsHz0fMxKBdxP2xlDTMJysrhhZPkP0N-T3RmvwKPCudtZZ1B_pXClJborU_mkJXcoH.jpg?_nc_cat=103\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=rn9m6Smz0WYQ7kNvwHv6ktJ\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQRyTDUzrV9PHuWH3QaiLWFvLFGM1fGBqf79NIOdckTlZQ\u0026oe=6B18D401\",\"A cool, stylish portrait of the person in the photo at night, on a city street, lit by direct on-camera flash. Bright, flattering light on the face, with glowing city lights blurred in the background. Keep their face, features, skin texture and body exactly as they are. \\n\\nIf there’s more than one person in the photo, keep every person and every pet: in the same arrangement, with no one added, removed or merged. \\n\\nShot on a 35mm film camera with direct flash and a shallow depth of field. Crisp focus on the face, fine film grain, rich color.\"]},{\"label\":\"973725969118107\",\"values\":[\"Resume\",\"https://scontent-sin6-3.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMwJZrUsBaYWaVgnce722YUl3xMfCGcQNlSSYlUHTaKUpDrwmv-8ughuN1SRYaSTXlLEy7m3_9O3wAudLoQ8g37.jpg?_nc_cat=106\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=8U46BBPjomoQ7kNvwFEnxnE\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQRc57WLcvhN-ytgJA5uVylozmzp0yrxPcdrQYvRZ4RC2w\u0026oe=6B1901FA\",\"$118\"]},{\"label\":\"29727373553529513\",\"values\":[\"Instagram profile pic\",\"https://scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQOxZQQ2Xir6Rc8NVp9iPmHhN-wpkWOIKFwVX9Dywv-7gI_iKcT2yzKIiTdllheKp89gk7GeGxsLIwzMxnZez3Pp.jpg?_nc_cat=100\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=xy_eKHKhyEEQ7kNvwEOuV23\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQRVjuRLtdTsQS_1fY1VibGs5Vf-mnH-Qz15D-1p6yqluQ\u0026oe=6B18F8B4\",\"A bold, high-energy fisheye photo of the person in the photo, shot up close on film. Pick the most flattering of three angles, staying close to how they're posed in the original: (1) top-down as they look straight up, (2) a three-quarter side view with the chin lifted, or (3) leaning in toward the camera in a tilted frame, with a hand reaching out. Keep the setting and time of day from the original, made more colorful, with punchy light and a touch of fill flash. Expressive and full of attitude. \\n\\nKeep their face, features, body shape and clothes the same. The fisheye can stretch their body and surroundings, but keep the face undistorted and flattering, and the hands realistic.\\n\\nIf there's more than one person, keep everyone and every pet, with no one added, removed or merged.\\n\\nSquare 1:1, face large and centered. Fine film grain, no dust or scratches.\"]},{\"label\":\"1463919632277614\",\"values\":[\"Color Studio\",\"https://scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQOUqProROs3kn2a6CQXAKxMNphWFFf53YiYKXsqImXHX-BvTsfvE21Jn4DjRG8bzJ8mpnJEUWwx18Ph26Gujzpc.jpg?_nc_cat=101\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=JM4NCF9_IssQ7kNvwEPEAf_\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQSUp8HaAYlpmA4AQd5NUCfWe8Jcc_jA4mkPZkl7ixQAFw\u0026oe=6B18EB53\",\"$119\"]},{\"label\":\"2308309499944190\",\"values\":[\"B\u0026W\",\"https://scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQMHiIofdcxRnWvHJfCiCtMU_uZntA2aZ_r5yKbPWK0WA6DVivFZWdEtSDqAxrpYSI29XU_i-iPQ3OZ82nnamMXb.jpg?_nc_cat=100\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=tAlKmPU4Z0YQ7kNvwHFntgF\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQSTgJXpAUSlJghilRvom-gx16PY91luoYV_G39a5PDmsA\u0026oe=6B18E464\",\"Re-light and re-pose the person in the reference photograph as a high-contrast black and white editorial portrait. \\n\\nSUBJECT — preserve exactly, do not stylize: face shape, bone structure, hairline and hair texture, skin tone and undertone as it maps to luminance, apparent age. Keep the clothes and accessories. \\n\\nBACKDROP — Plain light-grey plaster wall with subtle natural texture.\\n\\nLIGHTING — single hard key light from one side, sculpting the face with deep shadows and bright highlights. Minimal fill.\\n\\nCAMERA – Shot on 35mm film with warm, soft film color and natural skin tones. Crisp focus on the eyes, fine film grain.\\n\\nRENDER — black-and-white fashion editorial, magazine-cover quality. High contrast, deep rich blacks, clean whites. Natural skin texture with light retouching: remove blemishes, redness, under-eye shadows and shine, and tidy flyaway hair. Shot on a medium-format camera. Crisp focus on the eyes, fine film grain.\"]},{\"label\":\"3170054873385693\",\"values\":[\"Office\",\"https://scontent-sin11-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQPBrfX8GS9UViCAn4c31_Dz6-0a93WfQMpnkmgR74uYB7teehN2it46e6DscCLvDkVtBhzm_o5EPfiKPey4DlBp.jpg?_nc_cat=104\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=ojxar9u8RA0Q7kNvwHhMnQL\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026oh=00_AQSJ_wyXR114QNmHZMGu8rJTcLJFpvvq7I6dVxN9QQM3Ug\u0026oe=6B18E374\",\"$11a\"]}],\"mediaSuggestions\":[],\"title\":\"Select a style\"}]},{\"id\":\"1955588891810799\",\"agentOption\":null,\"chipTitle\":\"rockstar makeover\",\"clipTextRange\":{\"offset\":19,\"length\":17},\"displayedTitle\":\"Give this person a rockstar makeover\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"Give this person a Rockstar makeover\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\