s, rounded features, smooth face and integrated mouth. The skin is a single continuous sweep of uniformly coloured, evenly toned clay — flawless, seamless, and unmarked, like freshly smoothed plasticine. Cheeks are blended softly into the face with gradual tonal transitions only. Hair is made of shaped and blended strips of clay, without strands or flyaways. Warm studio light, pastel backdrop, clean surfaces throughout. Combine small shapes into bigger ones.\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[{\"stepType\":\"IMAGE_PICKER\",\"suggestedMediaCount\":1,\"textSuggestions\":[],\"detailedSuggestions\":[],\"mediaSuggestions\":[],\"title\":\"Choose an image\"}]},{\"id\":\"1973238329975258\",\"agentOption\":\"MODE_THINKING\",\"chipTitle\":\"enamel pin collection\",\"clipTextRange\":{\"offset\":10,\"length\":21},\"displayedTitle\":\"Create an enamel pin collection based on my Instagram profile\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"Create an Enamel pin collection based on my Instagram profile\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\"thumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQPivqC0p_hSt9lkEXvunyu4e2Nz2acGto2VuaYMSmL8Cq2fDmjGVG1jmORGCcEGof8QkdQhQ4Lt_rhiQU-9CTCW.png?_nc_cat=108\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=xuOi9FRgO2QQ7kNvwEu1_6g\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQRBfmOuyrtvcU7kLwmaOsKegk8teI_ej7vyEB96WW67AQ\u0026oe=6B18E758\",\"squareThumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQPivqC0p_hSt9lkEXvunyu4e2Nz2acGto2VuaYMSmL8Cq2fDmjGVG1jmORGCcEGof8QkdQhQ4Lt_rhiQU-9CTCW.png?_nc_cat=108\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=xuOi9FRgO2QQ7kNvwEu1_6g\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=JjdU0UrQPam67sg23QM5iQ\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQRBfmOuyrtvcU7kLwmaOsKegk8teI_ej7vyEB96WW67AQ\u0026oe=6B18E758\",\"placeholderThumbnailUri\"